      "source": [
        "# Automaic Door Opening by Human Detection Model\n",
        "### IoT: Servo move 90 degree when the model detect human. in Wokwi\n",
        "\n",
        "**The project:** your laptop camera looks for a phone. When it sees one, a light (or buzzer) turns on inside a **Wokwi** simulation. When the phone leaves, it turns off.\n",
        "\n",
        "**How to use this notebook**\n",
        "1. Run the cells **from top to bottom**, one at a time (press ▶ on the left of each cell).\n",
        "2. Cells marked **🔌 WOKWI** are not Python. Copy that code into [wokwi.com](https://wokwi.com) instead.\n",
        "3. Use **Chrome**, and click **Allow** when it asks for the camera.\n",
        "\n",
        "```\n",
        "Browser camera -> Colab (YOLO looks for a phone) --publish \"led\"/\"off\"--> [ MQTT broker ] --> Wokwi ESP32 -->Servo moves(90degree)--> LED / buzzer\n",
        "```"
      ]
    },
