      "source": [
        "## Step 2 · 🔌 WOKWI: build the circuit\n",
        "Open [wokwi.com](https://wokwi.com) → **New Project → ESP32**. Add 2 LEDs,a servo motor and a buzzer.\n",
        "\n",
        "| Part | Connection |\n",
        "|---|---|\n",
        "| Green LED | GPIO 26 → 220 Ω resistor → LED → GND |\n",
        "| Red LED | GPIO 27 → 220 Ω resistor → LED → GND |\n",
        "| Buzzer | pin 1 → GPIO 25, pin 2 → GND |\n",
        "| Servo | pin 1 → GPIO 15, pin 2 → GND, pin 3 -> 5V |\n",
        "\n",
        "**Blink test first** (no WiFi). Paste this into the Wokwi code box and press ▶. The green LED should blink.\n",
        "\n",
        "```cpp\n",
        "void setup() { pinMode(26, OUTPUT); }\n",
        "void loop() {\n",
        "  digitalWrite(26, HIGH); delay(500);\n",
        "  digitalWrite(26, LOW);  delay(500);\n",
        "}\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "Not blinking? It's the wiring. Not the AI, not the WiFi."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "qHpJv8IxaoLZ"
      },
      "source": [
        "## Step 3 · 🔌 WOKWI: teach the ESP32 to listen\n",
        "1. In Wokwi, open the **Library Manager** (book icon) and add **PubSubClient** and **ESP32Servo**.\n",
        "2. Replace the code with the sketch below.\n",
        "3. Change the `TOPIC` line to the topic printed in Step 1.\n",
        "4. Press ▶. The Serial Monitor should say `MQTT connected, listening on ...`.\n",
        "\n",
        "```cpp\n",
        "\n",
        "#include <WiFi.h>\n",
        "#include <PubSubClient.h>\n",
        "\n",
        "// =====================================\n",
        "// WIFI CONFIGURATION\n",
        "// =====================================\n",
        "\n",
        "const char* WIFI_SSID = \"Wokwi-GUEST\";\n",
        "const char* WIFI_PASS = \"\";\n",
        "\n",
        "// =====================================\n",
        "// MQTT CONFIGURATION\n",
        "// =====================================\n",
        "\n",
        "const char* BROKER = \"broker.hivemq.com\";\n",
        "const int MQTT_PORT = 1883;\n",
        "\n",
        "const char* TOPIC = \"ssse/w4/asaad042/cmd\";\n",
        "\n",
        "// =====================================\n",
        "// GPIO CONFIGURATION\n",
        "// =====================================\n",
        "\n",
        "const int GREEN_LED = 26;\n",
        "const int RED_LED = 27;\n",
        "const int BUZZER = 25;\n",
        "\n",
        "// =====================================\n",
        "// NETWORK OBJECTS\n",
        "// =====================================\n",
        "\n",
        "WiFiClient espClient;\n",
        "PubSubClient mqtt(espClient);\n",
        "\n",
        "// =====================================\n",
        "// TIMERS\n",
        "// =====================================\n",
        "\n",
        "unsigned long lastMqttAttempt = 0;\n",
        "\n",
        "const unsigned long MQTT_RETRY_INTERVAL = 5000;\n",
        "\n",
        "// =====================================\n",
        "// LED CONTROL\n",
        "// =====================================\n",
        "\n",
        "void setLEDs(bool green, bool red) {\n",
        "\n",
        "  digitalWrite(GREEN_LED, green ? HIGH : LOW);\n",
        "  digitalWrite(RED_LED, red ? HIGH : LOW);\n",
        "\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "// =====================================\n",
        "// BUZZER\n",
        "// =====================================\n",
        "\n",
        "void beep(int duration) {\n",
        "\n",
        "  unsigned long start = millis();\n",
        "\n",
        "  while (millis() - start < (unsigned long)duration) {\n",
        "\n",
        "    digitalWrite(BUZZER, HIGH);\n",
        "    delayMicroseconds(500);\n",
        "\n",
        "    digitalWrite(BUZZER, LOW);\n",
        "    delayMicroseconds(500);\n",
        "\n",
        "  }\n",
        "\n",
        "  digitalWrite(BUZZER, LOW);\n",
        "\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "// =====================================\n",
        "// MQTT MESSAGE CALLBACK\n",
        "// =====================================\n",
        "\n",
        "void onMessage(char* topic, byte* payload, unsigned int len) {\n",
        "\n",
        "  String msg = \"\";\n",
        "\n",
        "  for (unsigned int i = 0; i < len; i++) {\n",
        "    msg += (char)payload[i];\n",
        "  }\n",
        "\n",
        "  msg.trim();\n",
        "\n",
        "  Serial.println(\"\\n======================\");\n",
        "  Serial.print(\"COMMAND RECEIVED: \");\n",
        "  Serial.println(msg);\n",
        "\n",
        "  if (msg == \"led\") {\n",
        "\n",
        "    // GREEN ON, RED OFF\n",
        "    setLEDs(true, false);\n",
        "\n",
        "    digitalWrite(BUZZER, LOW);\n",
        "\n",
        "    Serial.println(\"GREEN LED: ON\");\n",
        "    Serial.println(\"RED LED: OFF\");\n",
        "\n",
        "  }\n",
        "\n",
        "  else if (msg == \"buzz\") {\n",
        "\n",
        "    // RED ON, GREEN OFF\n",
        "    setLEDs(false, true);\n",
        "\n",
        "    Serial.println(\"RED LED: ON\");\n",
        "    Serial.println(\"GREEN LED: OFF\");\n",
        "    Serial.println(\"BUZZER: ON\");\n",
        "\n",
        "    beep(400);\n",
        "\n",
        "    Serial.println(\"BUZZER: OFF\");\n",
        "    Serial.println(\"RED LED REMAINS ON\");\n",
        "\n",
        "  }\n",
        "\n",
        "  else if (msg == \"off\") {\n",
        "\n",
        "    // EVERYTHING OFF\n",
        "    setLEDs(false, false);\n",
        "\n",
        "    digitalWrite(BUZZER, LOW);\n",
        "\n",
        "    Serial.println(\"GREEN LED: OFF\");\n",
        "    Serial.println(\"RED LED: OFF\");\n",
        "    Serial.println(\"BUZZER: OFF\");\n",
        "\n",
        "  }\n",
        "\n",
        "  else {\n",
        "\n",
        "    Serial.println(\"UNKNOWN COMMAND\");\n",
        "\n",
        "  }\n",
        "\n",
        "  Serial.println(\"======================\");\n",
        "\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "// =====================================\n",
        "// WIFI CONNECTION\n",
        "// =====================================\n",
        "\n",
        "void connectWiFi() {\n",
        "\n",
        "  Serial.println(\"\\nConnecting to WiFi...\");\n",
        "\n",
        "  WiFi.mode(WIFI_STA);\n",
        "  WiFi.begin(WIFI_SSID, WIFI_PASS, 6);\n",
        "\n",
        "  int attempts = 0;\n",
        "\n",
        "  while (WiFi.status() != WL_CONNECTED && attempts < 50) {\n",
        "\n",
        "    delay(300);\n",
        "    Serial.print(\".\");\n",
        "\n",
        "    attempts++;\n",
        "\n",
        "  }\n",
        "\n",
        "  if (WiFi.status() == WL_CONNECTED) {\n",
        "\n",
        "    Serial.println(\"\\nWiFi Connected!\");\n",
        "\n",
        "    Serial.print(\"IP Address: \");\n",
        "    Serial.println(WiFi.localIP());\n",
        "\n",
        "  }\n",
        "\n",
        "  else {\n",
        "\n",
        "    Serial.println(\"\\nWiFi Connection Failed!\");\n",
        "\n",
        "    Serial.print(\"Status: \");\n",
        "    Serial.println(WiFi.status());\n",
        "\n",
        "  }\n",
        "\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "// =====================================\n",
        "// MQTT CONNECTION\n",
        "// =====================================\n",
        "\n",
        "void connectMqtt() {\n",
        "\n",
        "  if (mqtt.connected()) return;\n",
        "\n",
        "  Serial.println(\"\\nConnecting to HiveMQ...\");\n",
        "\n",
        "  // Generate a unique client ID\n",
        "  String clientID = \"ESP32-\";\n",
        "  clientID += String((uint32_t)esp_random(), HEX);\n",
        "\n",
        "  if (mqtt.connect(clientID.c_str())) {\n",
        "\n",
        "    Serial.println(\"MQTT CONNECTED!\");\n",
        "\n",
        "    if (mqtt.subscribe(TOPIC)) {\n",
        "\n",
        "      Serial.println(\"SUBSCRIPTION SUCCESSFUL!\");\n",
        "\n",
        "      Serial.print(\"Topic: \");\n",
        "      Serial.println(TOPIC);\n",
        "\n",
        "    }\n",
        "\n",
        "    else {\n",
        "\n",
        "      Serial.println(\"Subscription Failed!\");\n",
        "\n",
        "    }\n",
        "\n",
        "  }\n",
        "\n",
        "  else {\n",
        "\n",
        "    Serial.print(\"MQTT CONNECTION FAILED!\");\n",
        "    Serial.print(\" Error Code: \");\n",
        "    Serial.println(mqtt.state());\n",
        "\n",
        "  }\n",
        "\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "// =====================================\n",
        "// SETUP\n",
        "// =====================================\n",
        "\n",
        "void setup() {\n",
        "\n",
        "  Serial.begin(115200);\n",
        "\n",
        "  Serial.println(\"\\nESP32 MQTT CONTROL SYSTEM\");\n",
        "  Serial.println(\"=========================\");\n",
        "\n",
        "  pinMode(GREEN_LED, OUTPUT);\n",
        "  pinMode(RED_LED, OUTPUT);\n",
        "  pinMode(BUZZER, OUTPUT);\n",
        "\n",
        "  setLEDs(false, false);\n",
        "  digitalWrite(BUZZER, LOW);\n",
        "\n",
        "  // Connect WiFi\n",
        "  connectWiFi();\n",
        "\n",
        "  // Configure MQTT\n",
        "  mqtt.setServer(BROKER, MQTT_PORT);\n",
        "  mqtt.setCallback(onMessage);\n",
        "\n",
        "  mqtt.setKeepAlive(30);\n",
        "  mqtt.setSocketTimeout(10);\n",
        "\n",
        "  Serial.println(\"\\nSYSTEM READY!\");\n",
        "\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "// =====================================\n",
        "// MAIN LOOP\n",
        "// =====================================\n",
        "\n",
        "void loop() {\n",
        "\n",
        "  // Check WiFi\n",
        "  if (WiFi.status() != WL_CONNECTED) {\n",
        "\n",
        "    if (millis() - lastMqttAttempt >= MQTT_RETRY_INTERVAL) {\n",
        "\n",
        "      lastMqttAttempt = millis();\n",
        "\n",
        "      Serial.println(\"WiFi disconnected. Reconnecting...\");\n",
        "\n",
        "      WiFi.disconnect();\n",
        "      WiFi.begin(WIFI_SSID, WIFI_PASS, 6);\n",
        "\n",
        "    }\n",
        "\n",
        "    return;\n",
        "\n",
        "  }\n",
        "\n",
        "  // Check MQTT\n",
        "  if (!mqtt.connected()) {\n",
        "\n",
        "    if (millis() - lastMqttAttempt >= MQTT_RETRY_INTERVAL) {\n",
        "\n",
        "      lastMqttAttempt = millis();\n",
        "\n",
        "      connectMqtt();\n",
        "\n",
        "    }\n",
        "\n",
        "  }\n",
        "\n",
        "  else {\n",
        "\n",
        "    mqtt.loop();\n",
        "\n",
        "  }\n",
        "\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "**What the messages do:** `led` → green LED on · `buzz` → red LED + beep · `off` → everything off."
      ]
    },
