      "source": [
        "## Step 5 · Camera helpers\n",
        "The camera runs in your **browser**. These three functions grab one picture at a time (roughly 2 to 4 per second, so it's \"live enough\" for a light switch, not smooth video).\n",
        "\n",
        "Just run this cell. You don't need to understand the JavaScript."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
